// ProjectDeliveryS664 — Sprint 664: The D0425 verifier's procedure becomes the test-verify skill (D0438) instead of prompt text retyped every sprint. Two in-field Issues from sprint 663 are the charter: issue469, the verifier ran the touched set in the foreground and the harness's ten-minute cap killed it; issue471, a verifier told in prose to edit nothing hand-wrote two malformed triage statements onto red-yield obligations and reported a validate result from before its own edit, putting parser-coverage red (obligation01af4c5d). The skill states the mandate first - reads and runs, writes nothing, an owed write is an OWED WRITES line for the recorder - then the procedure in order: touched run detached with the launch epoch recorded, the gate set while it runs, the dispatch's probe pair by name, clippy with TIMEOUT reported under the build lock, the receipt read only after exit with outcome, at, stems, lib and head each its own line, and a fixed receipt shape. A dispatch names the skill, the binary, the receipt path, the probe pair and any expected red - nothing else about how to verify.. EXECUTE. 2 pts.
