    verification verifierProcedureIsASkillRetroGate : Test { :>> id = "3274502f-1279-4e90-9eae-41d8f89e2594"; :>> title = "Sprint 664 retro gate (autonomous, D0049)"; :>> createdAt = "2026-09-11"; :>> createdBy = "claudeOpus5"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::analyze; :>> procedureText = "AVOIDABLE-ISSUE SCAN: one new Issue this sprint - issue472 (Medium, in field): the suite receipt's at is the run's START (suite.rs:301 writes at: started) while the touched receipt's at is its END (touched.rs:342), so the verifier's '<at>launch: ok' on a one-second gap proved the receipt was this run's and not that the run finished; the primary read the duration from the receipt file's mtime (896 s) - tracked home dcReceiptAtMeansTheSameInBothReceipts, placed fourth by class. Avoidable: the skill's SUITE clause was written from the touched receipt's semantics without reading suite.rs; the check that caught it was the primary's own read of at against launch, which is D0388's rule applied to the verifier's row. The skill now names which stamp each receipt carries. FINDING 1: the DoD's ten-minute clause could not be met by the touched set because this sprint moved no Rust - the skill gained the full-suite clause so the case is exercised for real rather than deferred to the next Rust sprint, and the receipt's at/launch compare is what proves the run outlived the cap. FINDING 2: the probe pair was a scratchpad script run on HEAD's copy as the negative before the tree was read by the verifier (D0388), discarded rather than kept: the check is one-shot, its two cases are named in the DoD. FINDING 3, priority: the priority lens read 46 inversions before this sprint - three High items declared below twenty none-class ones - and the discharge was six moved lines; refineAssessPriority is a step the Refine ceremony owes every sprint, and the step's cost was under a minute."; }
    part verifierProcedureIsASkillRetroGateR1 : TestResult { :>> id = "d1e757f5-0d20-4558-b4a2-59154c676245"; :>> outcome = VerdictKind::proposed; :>> judgedAgainst = "24dbcfb"; :>> judgedAt = "2026-09-10"; :>> judgedBy = "claudeOpus5"; }
